		(property "Description" "Generic connector, single row, 01x04 -- the iteration-5 24-pin signal stub (blade-fit memo addendum 5): the CEC_CONN_2x5's 4 live circuits (-12V/PS_ON#/PWR_OK/GND) as a 1x4 blind-mate pair (daughterboard: right-angle Dupont-class pin header, pins down past the bottom edge; main board: vertical female socket, entry up); the 2x5's 6 reserved sense-return positions move to DNP solder pads (OQ-88 provision form only, decision unchanged)." (at 0 0 0) (show_name no) (do_not_autoplace no) (hide yes) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27))))
