		(property "Note" "H3a(c): CAN pair common-mode-choke position, PROVISIONED DNP as EMC insurance (never series beads on individual CAN lines). Real part if ever populated: TDK ACT45B-510-2P-TL003, CAN-bus-rated SMD-4P, 51uH/line, LCSC C76584 (matches the EPS/PCIe boards' choice for platform consistency). NO FOOTPRINT assigned yet -- no SMD-4P land exists in lib/vendor; add one before this can be populated. R_BYP_H/R_BYP_L (0R, populated by default) bridge FL1's H/L channels in parallel so CAN stays continuous with FL1 DNP; populating FL1 for real EMC insurance means removing both 0R bypasses."
			(at 284.48 335.28 0)
